WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.754
"I found you."

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.634
Are you ready? Did you sleep well?

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.094
Well, yeah.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:16.933
What?

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:23.314
I was just speaking poorly of you
with Rouis.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.607
So peaceful, huh?

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.993
You are acting even more strange today.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:37.287
Bill.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:38.997
You...

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:42.542
I gotta go to the bathroom!

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:45.128
I'll be right back.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.630
Hey, we have only ten minutes!

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:54.512
Gosh, you followed me to the bathroom.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:56.681
You must really be into me.

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:57.724
What are you...

00:00:58.308 --> 00:00:59.976
hiding under the costume?

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:06.483
So, I was not able to fool the keen
olfactory sense of a canine after all.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.570
Or what? You want a sip?

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:14.824
-That's...
-Rabbit's blood.

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:22.332
Of course, this is not
from one of the students.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.501
Just one of the older punks gave it to me.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:27.170
I've kept it, just in case.

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:30.673
Well, today is the "case," you know?

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:38.181
So, I really had no choice this time--

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.852
Hey, listen to me now.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.106
It should be easier to live in the shadow
like you.

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:49.025
But I want to live in the light!

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.611
So, this is a reasonable doping!

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.863
You always suck up to herbivores!

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:58.076
You just keep dodging responsibilities.
You would never understand me!

00:02:08.336 --> 00:02:10.213
He is right...

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.632
I can't talk back to him.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:17.262
Why don't you take responsibility
for your strength?

00:02:20.056 --> 00:02:21.766
I don't want to run away anymore.

